/-!
# Exact and rational vertices of Nopert #229

Candidate Nopert #229 is derived directly from the repair214 root construction (Compound M9b),
tweaking ring 1 by an azimuth rotation of -1.5e-3 rad, ring 2 radius by +1.5e-3,
top cap z by -1.5e-3, and deriving the z-coordinate of ring 1 algebraically to enforce exact coplanarity.

The vertices are scaled so that all vertices lie inside the unit sphere,
satisfying the GoodPoly invariant. The twenty vertices are generated by
rotating four seed vertices around the z-axis in increments of 2π/5.

TODO: If coordinates are ever regenerated or upgraded to the exact 27-facet model:
1. The exact rational export with power-of-two denominators (2^52) and exact quad coplanarity
   (defect = 0 in ℚ) is implemented in `ruperts/codebdd229.cc` (`GenerateBestPossibleRationalVertices`).
2. A drop-in replacement file is generated at `vertices229_exact27.lean`.
3. See `noteperts/QUAD_FACES.md` for full derivation, error metrics, and downstream proof implications.
-/

